1
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao.</font></font>

2
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao.</font></font>

3
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:26,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forgive me.</font></font>

4
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

5
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:35,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou!</font></font>

6
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou.</font></font>

7
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened last night?</font></font>

8
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did we suddenly pass out?</font></font>

9
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Last night,</font></font>

10
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a thick fog rolled in.</font></font>

11
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And then we</font></font>

12
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">blacked out.</font></font>

13
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good thing Yuwen Hao passed out too.</font></font>

14
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise, you'd be</font></font>

15
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:53,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">burying me right now.</font></font>

16
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those immortal jerks are always trying</font></font>

17
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:57,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to wipe us out.</font></font>

18
00:00:57,990 --> 00:00:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now I've finally got one at my mercy.</font></font>

19
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make sure he never wakes up.</font></font>

20
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:04,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're still showing him mercy?</font></font>

21
00:01:04,470 --> 00:01:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once he wakes up,</font></font>

22
00:01:05,270 --> 00:01:06,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're as good as dead.</font></font>

23
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Master finds out what I did,</font></font>

24
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:09,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll be furious.</font></font>

25
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides, he did</font></font>

26
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">save both our lives once.</font></font>

27
00:01:16,390 --> 00:01:17,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know how to deal with him.</font></font>

28
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪</font></font>

29
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪</font></font>

30
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Desire blinds my eyes♪</font></font>

31
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪</font></font>

32
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪</font></font>

33
00:03:23,540 --> 00:03:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪</font></font>

34
00:03:31,380 --> 00:03:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪</font></font>

35
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪</font></font>

36
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blossom in Darkness]</font></font>

37
00:03:52,900 --> 00:03:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]</font></font>

38
00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 6]</font></font>

39
00:04:24,710 --> 00:04:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's her.</font></font>

40
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What exactly did you just do?</font></font>

41
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At Mount Zhaowu,</font></font>

42
00:04:35,470 --> 00:04:36,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they follow the Path of Detachment.</font></font>

43
00:04:37,030 --> 00:04:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That spiritual mark</font></font>

44
00:04:37,910 --> 00:04:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is the symbol of their cultivation.</font></font>

45
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's like the immortal core of other sect disciples.</font></font>

46
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once they lose it,</font></font>

47
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's like losing their virtue.</font></font>

48
00:04:46,170 --> 00:04:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Their faith in the immortal path is shattered.</font></font>

49
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They can't even use magic anymore.</font></font>

50
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:51,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So when he wakes up</font></font>

51
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and thinks you've</font></font>

52
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stolen his virtue,</font></font>

53
00:04:54,810 --> 00:04:56,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll be beside himself with shame!</font></font>

54
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:57,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give it back to me.</font></font>

55
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:02,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come and get it.</font></font>

56
00:05:05,790 --> 00:05:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

57
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:08,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

58
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

59
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could you be so shameless?</font></font>

60
00:05:15,470 --> 00:05:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're calling me shameless?</font></font>

61
00:05:17,910 --> 00:05:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why don't you ask yourself</font></font>

62
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what was going through your mind</font></font>

63
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">while you were unconscious?</font></font>

64
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:23,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you hadn't let your heart stray,</font></font>

65
00:05:24,030 --> 00:05:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how could I have so easily</font></font>

66
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">taken your spiritual mark?</font></font>

67
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not like you heartless</font></font>

68
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mount Zhaowu disciples.</font></font>

69
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't kill you while you're unconscious.</font></font>

70
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I merely</font></font>

71
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">took this little thing to keep you in check,</font></font>

72
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:34,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so you'd lose your powers</font></font>

73
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and couldn't kill me.</font></font>

74
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As for this mark,</font></font>

75
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my life depends on it now.</font></font>

76
00:05:39,710 --> 00:05:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'll hold on to it for you.</font></font>

77
00:05:41,710 --> 00:05:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

78
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't leave.</font></font>

79
00:05:44,350 --> 00:05:45,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You... You...</font></font>

80
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:46,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's powerless now!</font></font>

81
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll... I'll bite him to death!</font></font>

82
00:05:50,030 --> 00:05:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let go!</font></font>

83
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey.</font></font>

84
00:06:13,390 --> 00:06:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something's happened at the village entrance.</font></font>

85
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They say the rabbit demon's been caught.</font></font>

86
00:06:16,750 --> 00:06:17,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rabbit demon?</font></font>

87
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey, have you forgotten?</font></font>

88
00:06:19,390 --> 00:06:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There was a rabbit demon</font></font>

89
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that took human form</font></font>

90
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and snuck into our village to cause trouble.</font></font>

91
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ever since then,</font></font>

92
00:06:23,950 --> 00:06:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">strangers have been banned from entering.</font></font>

93
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From the looks of it,</font></font>

94
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they must've caught the rabbit demon.</font></font>

95
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey!</font></font>

96
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Beat him to death! - Kill him!</font></font>

97
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait! Hold on!</font></font>

98
00:06:43,390 --> 00:06:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please, hear me out!</font></font>

99
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's been a misunderstanding.</font></font>

100
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're really not</font></font>

101
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the rabbit demon you're looking for.</font></font>

102
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two</font></font>

103
00:06:48,870 --> 00:06:49,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have been lurking outside the village</font></font>

104
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and snooping around.</font></font>

105
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must be rabbit demons in disguise!</font></font>

106
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're trying to sneak in and eat us, aren't you?</font></font>

107
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:54,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- That's right! - Exactly!</font></font>

108
00:06:54,290 --> 00:06:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone,</font></font>

109
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there must be</font></font>

110
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">some misunderstanding.</font></font>

111
00:06:57,750 --> 00:06:58,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're just passing through.</font></font>

112
00:06:58,750 --> 00:06:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're lying!</font></font>

113
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This road</font></font>

114
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">doesn't lead anywhere!</font></font>

115
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could you be passing through?</font></font>

116
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:02,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly!</font></font>

117
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:03,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rabbit demons are cunning!</font></font>

118
00:07:03,830 --> 00:07:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop wasting your breath, everyone!</font></font>

119
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:06,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kill them!</font></font>

120
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:14,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Kill them! - Kill them!</font></font>

121
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao.</font></font>

122
00:07:15,170 --> 00:07:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kill them!</font></font>

123
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin?</font></font>

124
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey.</font></font>

125
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you know these two?</font></font>

126
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey?</font></font>

127
00:07:34,590 --> 00:07:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He...</font></font>

128
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When...</font></font>

129
00:07:36,490 --> 00:07:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When did he get married?</font></font>

130
00:07:38,430 --> 00:07:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was about to ask you.</font></font>

131
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on?</font></font>

132
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:42,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How should I know?</font></font>

133
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're her husband now,</font></font>

134
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you don't know?</font></font>

135
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong.</font></font>

136
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Strangers aren't allowed near the village.</font></font>

137
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could you just</font></font>

138
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">untie them without permission?</font></font>

139
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Exactly! - That's right!</font></font>

140
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone,</font></font>

141
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">these two</font></font>

142
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">seem to know my husband.</font></font>

143
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:53,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're not rabbit demons.</font></font>

144
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all a misunderstanding.</font></font>

145
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:56,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well...</font></font>

146
00:08:03,950 --> 00:08:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must be my cousin's wife.</font></font>

147
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm Yamao,</font></font>

148
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his...</font></font>

149
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">distant cousin.</font></font>

150
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What cousin?</font></font>

151
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How come my husband</font></font>

152
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">never mentioned you?</font></font>

153
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We haven't been in touch for ages.</font></font>

154
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But then I heard</font></font>

155
00:08:19,810 --> 00:08:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'd settled down and gotten married here.</font></font>

156
00:08:24,630 --> 00:08:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So my husband and I</font></font>

157
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">thought we'd pay you a visit.</font></font>

158
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Unless you want</font></font>

159
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to be burned as a rabbit demon,</font></font>

160
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep your mouth shut.</font></font>

161
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And don't forget,</font></font>

162
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still have your spiritual mark.</font></font>

163
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Greetings, cousin.</font></font>

164
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Greetings, sis.</font></font>

165
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you're Mr. Cheng</font></font>

166
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:57,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and Xiangyuan's family.</font></font>

167
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What a misunderstanding!</font></font>

168
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A terrible misunderstanding!</font></font>

169
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Cheng?</font></font>

170
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on in! Please, come inside!</font></font>

171
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:16,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We haven't used this spare room in ages.</font></font>

172
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You and your husband can stay here.</font></font>

173
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But since this was so last-minute,</font></font>

174
00:09:20,390 --> 00:09:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm afraid you'll have to</font></font>

175
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">tidy it up yourselves.</font></font>

176
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm expecting a baby,</font></font>

177
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so it's a little difficult for me.</font></font>

178
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you looking at me for?</font></font>

179
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is all because you didn't tell me</font></font>

180
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:35,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they were coming.</font></font>

181
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

182
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go get some bedding.</font></font>

183
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey, take good care of our guests.</font></font>

184
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin.</font></font>

185
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you terrorizing innocent villagers?</font></font>

186
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Last time, I told you your skills were lacking</font></font>

187
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and told you to go home and practice.</font></font>

188
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you?</font></font>

189
00:10:00,390 --> 00:10:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you find out?</font></font>

190
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:09,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on, fight.</font></font>

191
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, fight.</font></font>

192
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you looking at me for?</font></font>

193
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your spiritual mark and mystical flower?</font></font>

194
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can both forget about getting them back.</font></font>

195
00:10:18,790 --> 00:10:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One of you lost his spiritual mark,</font></font>

196
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the other's powers are sealed by the Wanjun Lock.</font></font>

197
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From now on,</font></font>

198
00:10:24,150 --> 00:10:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm in charge here!</font></font>

199
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you going to explain</font></font>

200
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why she's calling you her husband?</font></font>

201
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since when did you get married</font></font>

202
00:10:41,270 --> 00:10:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get your wife pregnant?</font></font>

203
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I'd shown up any later,</font></font>

204
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would I be congratulating you on becoming a father?</font></font>

205
00:10:46,130 --> 00:10:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Calm down!</font></font>

206
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:47,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Lordship probably</font></font>

207
00:10:47,740 --> 00:10:48,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has no idea what's going on either.</font></font>

208
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord, please explain!</font></font>

209
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey is</font></font>

210
00:10:51,010 --> 00:10:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what a married woman</font></font>

211
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">calls the man she loves.</font></font>

212
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't let her take advantage of you, did you?</font></font>

213
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's got a mind of his own.</font></font>

214
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could anyone take advantage of him so easily?</font></font>

215
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who's taking advantage of whom</font></font>

216
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">remains to be seen.</font></font>

217
00:11:05,550 --> 00:11:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I woke up and someone brought me here.</font></font>

218
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She seems to have mistaken me for someone else.</font></font>

219
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She keeps calling me her husband.</font></font>

220
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:13,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you have in common</font></font>

221
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with this Cheng Kong they keep mentioning?</font></font>

222
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do Xiangyuan and the villagers</font></font>

223
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all mistake you for him?</font></font>

224
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And another thing.</font></font>

225
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Knowing you,</font></font>

226
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how could you let anyone push you around?</font></font>

227
00:11:24,670 --> 00:11:25,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Wanjun Lock has sealed his powers.</font></font>

228
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Without powers,</font></font>

229
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he had no choice but to hide deep in the mountains</font></font>

230
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to escape the immortal sects.</font></font>

231
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Coming from someone who nearly</font></font>

232
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">died on Mount Leiguan,</font></font>

233
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's rich.</font></font>

234
00:11:40,550 --> 00:11:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I sense a wisp of my malice here.</font></font>

235
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See? I told you!</font></font>

236
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My compass</font></font>

237
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:45,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">really does come in handy!</font></font>

238
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your malice?</font></font>

239
00:11:46,630 --> 00:11:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where is it?</font></font>

240
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry up and find it!</font></font>

241
00:11:48,390 --> 00:11:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Water your mystical flower with it,</font></font>

242
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then give me back my master's soul crystal.</font></font>

243
00:11:50,550 --> 00:11:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This whole place is shrouded in demonic aura.</font></font>

244
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't find it.</font></font>

245
00:11:53,670 --> 00:11:54,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao,</font></font>

246
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're helping him find his malice?</font></font>

247
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

248
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've gone too far!</font></font>

249
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't you realize</font></font>

250
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're helping him become the Devil Incarnate?</font></font>

251
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me back my spiritual mark.</font></font>

252
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What spiritual mark?</font></font>

253
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, to put it simply,</font></font>

254
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">this</font></font>

255
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">immortal jerk from Mount Zhaowu</font></font>

256
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wants to take</font></font>

257
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Moonlit Revival Herb's herb core</font></font>

258
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and give it to his master.</font></font>

259
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And this little herb,</font></font>

260
00:12:14,050 --> 00:12:15,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to save her own life,</font></font>

261
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stole his virtue.</font></font>

262
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now he wants his spiritual mark back</font></font>

263
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so he can regain his powers,</font></font>

264
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">kill you first,</font></font>

265
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then kill her,</font></font>

266
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and finally come after me.</font></font>

267
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You want to kill her?</font></font>

268
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's it to you?</font></font>

269
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Enough!</font></font>

270
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at you two,</font></font>

271
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">squabbling like a couple of helpless chicks.</font></font>

272
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's the point of fighting?</font></font>

273
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can barely protect yourselves.</font></font>

274
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe that mighty demon should come to the village</font></font>

275
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and swallow you both whole!</font></font>

276
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then you can fight inside its belly</font></font>

277
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:42,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to your hearts' content!</font></font>

278
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Nonsense. - Absurd.</font></font>

279
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to fight,</font></font>

280
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can do it anytime.</font></font>

281
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

282
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if you're going to find your malice here,</font></font>

283
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you need to put your grudges aside for now.</font></font>

284
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:57,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And you!</font></font>

285
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As a disciple of Mount Zhaowu,</font></font>

286
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't it your duty to vanquish devils...</font></font>

287
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">demons...</font></font>

288
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean, monsters,</font></font>

289
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and protect innocent people?</font></font>

290
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something's clearly wrong with this place.</font></font>

291
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't you want to find out what's going on?</font></font>

292
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This village</font></font>

293
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">shuns outsiders because of rumors about a rabbit demon.</font></font>

294
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For now,</font></font>

295
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we need to keep</font></font>

296
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our true identities hidden</font></font>

297
00:13:18,790 --> 00:13:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if we want to stay here</font></font>

298
00:13:20,910 --> 00:13:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and accomplish what we each came for.</font></font>

299
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That means putting aside our differences</font></font>

300
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and working together.</font></font>

301
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Impossible.</font></font>

302
00:13:28,870 --> 00:13:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See? You two already agree on something.</font></font>

303
00:13:39,670 --> 00:13:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on?</font></font>

304
00:13:41,390 --> 00:13:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Am I interrupting your reunion?</font></font>

305
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, not at all.</font></font>

306
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me help you, Xiangyuan.</font></font>

307
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:52,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We only have one quilt left.</font></font>

308
00:13:52,550 --> 00:13:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm afraid</font></font>

309
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you and your husband will have to share it tonight.</font></font>

310
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright, honey.</font></font>

311
00:13:58,870 --> 00:13:59,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's let them rest.</font></font>

312
00:14:00,510 --> 00:14:01,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've traveled such a long way.</font></font>

313
00:14:01,330 --> 00:14:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must be exhausted.</font></font>

314
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We shouldn't disturb you.</font></font>

315
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two are sharing a room tonight?</font></font>

316
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey, what are you talking about?</font></font>

317
00:14:13,030 --> 00:14:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're husband and wife.</font></font>

318
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course they'll share a room.</font></font>

319
00:14:17,030 --> 00:14:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't allow it.</font></font>

320
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong!</font></font>

321
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:27,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What have I done to upset you?</font></font>

322
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You won't even talk to me!</font></font>

323
00:14:30,270 --> 00:14:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm pregnant,</font></font>

324
00:14:31,270 --> 00:14:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I carried all that bedding here!</font></font>

325
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't even offer to help!</font></font>

326
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:35,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you even care about me as your wife?</font></font>

327
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You never used to treat me this way.</font></font>

328
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before every trip,</font></font>

329
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd promise to bring me morning glories.</font></font>

330
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But this time, you completely forgot.</font></font>

331
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:44,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

332
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:47,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I barely recognize you anymore.</font></font>

333
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes I even feel</font></font>

334
00:14:49,250 --> 00:14:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like you're not my husband!</font></font>

335
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course he is, Xiangyuan!</font></font>

336
00:14:53,630 --> 00:14:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's your husband!</font></font>

337
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:57,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You see, my cousin</font></font>

338
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hurt his head on this last trip.</font></font>

339
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:00,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why he's been acting so strangely.</font></font>

340
00:15:06,390 --> 00:15:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had no idea he'd hurt his head.</font></font>

341
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:09,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you alright?</font></font>

342
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's fine! He's fine!</font></font>

343
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just a minor injury. He'll recover soon.</font></font>

344
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry, you two. I...</font></font>

345
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I must have frightened you just now.</font></font>

346
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:18,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

347
00:15:18,870 --> 00:15:20,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please, make yourselves comfortable.</font></font>

348
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:20,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll...</font></font>

349
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go prepare dinner for you.</font></font>

350
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See what you've done?</font></font>

351
00:15:30,270 --> 00:15:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All that arguing!</font></font>

352
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Xiangyuan gets suspicious,</font></font>

353
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll all be mistaken for rabbit demons</font></font>

354
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and end up in serious trouble!</font></font>

355
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

356
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stay here and clean the room with Youyou.</font></font>

357
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin!</font></font>

358
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come outside with me.</font></font>

359
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright, let's hear it.</font></font>

360
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:55,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you bring me out here?</font></font>

361
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't Xiangyuan tell you?</font></font>

362
00:15:57,790 --> 00:15:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Her husband always brings her</font></font>

363
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:00,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">morning glories when he comes home.</font></font>

364
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:02,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've already upset her enough.</font></font>

365
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course we're going to find some</font></font>

366
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so you can make it up to her.</font></font>

367
00:16:07,510 --> 00:16:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You brought me out here</font></font>

368
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just for that?</font></font>

369
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nothing else you want to ask?</font></font>

370
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course.</font></font>

371
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">While we're at it,</font></font>

372
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my master's soul crystal</font></font>

373
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is still in one piece, right?</font></font>

374
00:16:22,910 --> 00:16:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He must mean a lot to you</font></font>

375
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">since you're always worrying about him.</font></font>

376
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What kind of person</font></font>

377
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was he when he was alive?</font></font>

378
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean, "was alive"?</font></font>

379
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My master's still alive!</font></font>

380
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:36,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You wounded him so badly</font></font>

381
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that he ended up like this.</font></font>

382
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And now you're asking me</font></font>

383
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what kind of person he is?</font></font>

384
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's the best person in the world!</font></font>

385
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never even met your master.</font></font>

386
00:16:44,390 --> 00:16:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I have hurt him?</font></font>

387
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really don't remember a thing?</font></font>

388
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That figures.</font></font>

389
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you unleashed that rain of fire,</font></font>

390
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you were trying to destroy the Saintess's Shrine.</font></font>

391
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As for everyone else,</font></font>

392
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we weren't even worth your attention.</font></font>

393
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:00,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So of course you had no idea</font></font>

394
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that your devastating attack</font></font>

395
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">also caught my master and me</font></font>

396
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the middle of it.</font></font>

397
00:17:04,790 --> 00:17:05,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No wonder</font></font>

398
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can talk about it like it's nothing.</font></font>

399
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never unleashed any rain of fire.</font></font>

400
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you blaming me</font></font>

401
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for something I didn't do?</font></font>

402
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And this Saintess's Shrine you mentioned,</font></font>

403
00:17:16,790 --> 00:17:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why would I want to destroy it?</font></font>

404
00:17:19,790 --> 00:17:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The shrine</font></font>

405
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">belongs to the Saintess of the Tides.</font></font>

406
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She sealed you away for a thousand years.</font></font>

407
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:25,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you afraid of her?</font></font>

408
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So she's the one</font></font>

409
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who sealed me away.</font></font>

410
00:17:29,790 --> 00:17:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I broke her seal with ease.</font></font>

411
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She can't have been that powerful.</font></font>

412
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't even remember</font></font>

413
00:17:35,940 --> 00:17:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Saintess of the Tides?</font></font>

414
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As far back as I can remember,</font></font>

415
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was sealed inside Mount Qihuang.</font></font>

416
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember nothing before that.</font></font>

417
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The only thing I do remember</font></font>

418
00:17:48,550 --> 00:17:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is someone connected to the mystical flower.</font></font>

419
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you're saying</font></font>

420
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you really weren't behind that rain of fire?</font></font>

421
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How is that possible?</font></font>

422
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who else could've done it?</font></font>

423
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you don't believe me,</font></font>

424
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why bother asking?</font></font>

425
00:18:03,550 --> 00:18:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From now on,</font></font>

426
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't answer any more of your questions.</font></font>

427
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you upset again?</font></font>

428
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then again,</font></font>

429
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">knowing how Qi Fengyin</font></font>

430
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">always means what he says,</font></font>

431
00:18:17,790 --> 00:18:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he wouldn't bother lying to me.</font></font>

432
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if he's telling the truth,</font></font>

433
00:18:23,270 --> 00:18:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who unleashed that rain of fire?</font></font>

434
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that enough?</font></font>

435
00:18:39,270 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you give Xiangyuan</font></font>

436
00:18:40,070 --> 00:18:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that pile of dead vines,</font></font>

437
00:18:41,590 --> 00:18:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the three of us might as well</font></font>

438
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">pack our bags and leave the village.</font></font>

439
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really need to teach you</font></font>

440
00:18:51,570 --> 00:18:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how to act like a proper husband.</font></font>

441
00:18:53,350 --> 00:18:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan is pregnant.</font></font>

442
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since you're pretending to be her husband,</font></font>

443
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:58,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you should be more considerate.</font></font>

444
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">People's feelings are fragile.</font></font>

445
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Treat her like someone you truly love,</font></font>

446
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the way you care for your mystical flower.</font></font>

447
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The mystical flower isn't someone I love.</font></font>

448
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why have you worked so hard</font></font>

449
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to make it bloom?</font></font>

450
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't ask what doesn't concern you.</font></font>

451
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:43,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got plenty of secrets.</font></font>

452
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides the mystical flower,</font></font>

453
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is there anything else you hold dear?</font></font>

454
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What does it mean to hold something dear?</font></font>

455
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It means</font></font>

456
00:19:56,070 --> 00:19:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">something you treasure most,</font></font>

457
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or someone.</font></font>

458
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'd protect her</font></font>

459
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and never let anyone hurt her.</font></font>

460
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:06,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, by that definition,</font></font>

461
00:20:06,450 --> 00:20:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm protecting you right now,</font></font>

462
00:20:08,750 --> 00:20:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keeping Mount Zhaowu from hurting you.</font></font>

463
00:20:11,270 --> 00:20:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does that make you someone I hold dear?</font></font>

464
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I... Of course not!</font></font>

465
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're only working together</font></font>

466
00:20:24,550 --> 00:20:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because we both have something to gain.</font></font>

467
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you truly love someone,</font></font>

468
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just thinking about her</font></font>

469
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">makes your heart feel</font></font>

470
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like a feather is brushing against it,</font></font>

471
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">giving you butterflies.</font></font>

472
00:20:38,290 --> 00:20:39,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you can't be with her,</font></font>

473
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your heart aches so badly</font></font>

474
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can barely breathe.</font></font>

475
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:44,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And when she's sad,</font></font>

476
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you feel even worse than she does.</font></font>

477
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't need you to teach me.</font></font>

478
00:21:03,240 --> 00:21:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I weren't trying</font></font>

479
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to help you recover your malice</font></font>

480
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get my master's soul crystal back...</font></font>

481
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't bother teaching you!</font></font>

482
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's so thoughtful of you, honey.</font></font>

483
00:21:20,410 --> 00:21:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You even got all these for me.</font></font>

484
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:26,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was nothing.</font></font>

485
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why aren't you eating?</font></font>

486
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We live deep in the mountains.</font></font>

487
00:21:33,790 --> 00:21:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry the food is so simple.</font></font>

488
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hope you don't mind.</font></font>

489
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not at all.</font></font>

490
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:39,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your cooking is delicious, Xiangyuan.</font></font>

491
00:21:40,790 --> 00:21:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all that rabbit demon's fault.</font></font>

492
00:21:42,070 --> 00:21:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It keeps sneaking in and eating our livestock.</font></font>

493
00:21:44,350 --> 00:21:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And we can never catch it.</font></font>

494
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:46,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now there's less and less</font></font>

495
00:21:46,790 --> 00:21:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">food left in the village.</font></font>

496
00:21:47,830 --> 00:21:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If a demon is causing trouble,</font></font>

497
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why not ask an immortal sect to get rid of it?</font></font>

498
00:21:52,030 --> 00:21:53,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've thought about that.</font></font>

499
00:21:53,830 --> 00:21:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But we're so far from anywhere,</font></font>

500
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the mountain fog gets so thick at night</font></font>

501
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that no one can find their way out.</font></font>

502
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao, what's wrong?</font></font>

503
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine.</font></font>

504
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you having trouble</font></font>

505
00:22:14,850 --> 00:22:15,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">adjusting to the climate here?</font></font>

506
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you, Xiangyuan.</font></font>

507
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think</font></font>

508
00:22:24,270 --> 00:22:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">an old injury hasn't fully healed.</font></font>

509
00:22:26,510 --> 00:22:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's been giving me trouble.</font></font>

510
00:22:27,830 --> 00:22:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But it's nothing serious.</font></font>

511
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Some medicine should help.</font></font>

512
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

513
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then get some rest after dinner.</font></font>

514
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, let's eat!</font></font>

515
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, one more thing.</font></font>

516
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once night falls,</font></font>

517
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whatever you do, don't leave</font></font>

518
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your room.</font></font>

519
00:22:46,590 --> 00:22:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've already got</font></font>

520
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your spiritual mark.</font></font>

521
00:22:48,830 --> 00:22:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Given where things stand between us,</font></font>

522
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you really need to avoid me like this?</font></font>

523
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You took it by force.</font></font>

524
00:22:54,030 --> 00:22:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never agreed to it.</font></font>

525
00:23:03,110 --> 00:23:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you curious</font></font>

526
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what exactly I did to you</font></font>

527
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get your spiritual mark?</font></font>

528
00:23:07,750 --> 00:23:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you do?</font></font>

529
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:09,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, I couldn't possibly say.</font></font>

530
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'll have to figure it out yourself.</font></font>

531
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin?</font></font>

532
00:23:25,270 --> 00:23:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing here?</font></font>

533
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Knowing someone wants to kill you,</font></font>

534
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how could I leave you two alone?</font></font>

535
00:23:34,790 --> 00:23:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And what's it supposed to look like</font></font>

536
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with two men and a woman alone</font></font>

537
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:37,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in one room?</font></font>

538
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get out of here!</font></font>

539
00:23:43,510 --> 00:23:44,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fine.</font></font>

540
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no talking sense into you.</font></font>

541
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then you stay with him.</font></font>

542
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll bunk with Xiangyuan.</font></font>

543
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you just give her?</font></font>

544
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something from Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

545
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course you've never seen it before.</font></font>

546
00:24:02,030 --> 00:24:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, I've seen enough.</font></font>

547
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nothing from Mount Zhaowu</font></font>

548
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is ever any good.</font></font>

549
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At best, it's just filthy.</font></font>

550
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't forget,</font></font>

551
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got what matters most</font></font>

552
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to both of you.</font></font>

553
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If either of you causes trouble,</font></font>

554
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're all going down together.</font></font>

555
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin's powers</font></font>

556
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are sealed by the Wanjun Lock.</font></font>

557
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Night has finally fallen.</font></font>

558
00:24:57,070 --> 00:24:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The moon is especially bright tonight.</font></font>

559
00:24:59,110 --> 00:25:00,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just what I need.</font></font>

560
00:26:05,270 --> 00:26:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, look at you!</font></font>

561
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never thought someone from a respected sect</font></font>

562
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would stoop so low</font></font>

563
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as to sneak around like a thief.</font></font>

564
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

565
00:26:10,550 --> 00:26:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got some nerve accusing others.</font></font>

566
00:26:12,750 --> 00:26:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

567
00:26:15,110 --> 00:26:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the only one here who can use magic.</font></font>

568
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'm calling the shots!</font></font>

569
00:26:17,550 --> 00:26:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me back my master's soul crystal!</font></font>

570
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Trying to take it by force?</font></font>

571
00:26:21,790 --> 00:26:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even with the Wanjun Lock,</font></font>

572
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can still crush your master's soul crystal.</font></font>

573
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead. Try me.</font></font>

574
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao, hold him down.</font></font>

575
00:26:28,550 --> 00:26:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me back my spiritual mark first.</font></font>

576
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:29,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

577
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

578
00:26:41,790 --> 00:26:42,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan, we...</font></font>

579
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

580
00:26:47,550 --> 00:26:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please, let me explain, Xiangyuan!</font></font>

581
00:27:18,830 --> 00:27:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan.</font></font>

582
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please don't cry.</font></font>

583
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's been a misunderstanding.</font></font>

584
00:27:24,110 --> 00:27:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I explain what happened?</font></font>

585
00:27:27,590 --> 00:27:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan.</font></font>

586
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:42,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't you tell there's something wrong with her?</font></font>

587
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong with Xiangyuan?</font></font>

588
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something's coming.</font></font>

589
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's the villagers from earlier today.</font></font>

590
00:28:34,030 --> 00:28:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're clearly human.</font></font>

591
00:28:35,550 --> 00:28:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So why do they give off such a ghostly aura?</font></font>

592
00:28:44,270 --> 00:28:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two,</font></font>

593
00:28:45,830 --> 00:28:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stay close to me.</font></font>

594
00:29:41,030 --> 00:29:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're awake.</font></font>

595
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did I wake you?</font></font>

596
00:29:59,240 --> 00:29:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan.</font></font>

597
00:30:01,070 --> 00:30:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you sleep well last night?</font></font>

598
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you get hungry</font></font>

599
00:30:07,270 --> 00:30:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get up to find something to eat?</font></font>

600
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't we go to bed early</font></font>

601
00:30:28,340 --> 00:30:29,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">last night?</font></font>

602
00:30:30,070 --> 00:30:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides,</font></font>

603
00:30:31,110 --> 00:30:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm pregnant.</font></font>

604
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't just eat whatever I want.</font></font>

605
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you're still half asleep</font></font>

606
00:30:35,790 --> 00:30:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and talking nonsense.</font></font>

607
00:30:37,440 --> 00:30:39,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your husband and mine are already up.</font></font>

608
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should wash up</font></font>

609
00:30:40,750 --> 00:30:41,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and come have breakfast.</font></font>

610
00:30:58,720 --> 00:30:59,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou!</font></font>

611
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou!</font></font>

612
00:31:01,590 --> 00:31:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou!</font></font>

613
00:31:03,440 --> 00:31:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm coming.</font></font>

614
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want?</font></font>

615
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why wake me from my beauty sleep so early?</font></font>

616
00:31:08,170 --> 00:31:08,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou.</font></font>

617
00:31:08,920 --> 00:31:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you remember what happened</font></font>

618
00:31:09,860 --> 00:31:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">last night?</font></font>

619
00:31:11,240 --> 00:31:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Last night?</font></font>

620
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was so sleepy last night</font></font>

621
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that I fell asleep as soon as I turned back into a doll.</font></font>

622
00:31:17,590 --> 00:31:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

623
00:31:19,270 --> 00:31:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

624
00:31:20,510 --> 00:31:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Eating...</font></font>

625
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Eating a live chicken?</font></font>

626
00:31:24,350 --> 00:31:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ghostly figures in the fog?</font></font>

627
00:31:26,510 --> 00:31:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I only</font></font>

628
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">went to bed a little early,</font></font>

629
00:31:29,220 --> 00:31:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I missed all that excitement?</font></font>

630
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened next?</font></font>

631
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, tell me.</font></font>

632
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I woke up,</font></font>

633
00:31:34,270 --> 00:31:35,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was back in my room.</font></font>

634
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So...</font></font>

635
00:31:40,510 --> 00:31:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even you fell for it?</font></font>

636
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:45,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Silly Yamao.</font></font>

637
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why bring that up?</font></font>

638
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If that rabbit demon hadn't been</font></font>

639
00:31:48,420 --> 00:31:49,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">lurking in the shadows,</font></font>

640
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and His Lordship hadn't been so weak</font></font>

641
00:31:50,790 --> 00:31:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that it could take advantage of him,</font></font>

642
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there's no way His Lordship would've...</font></font>

643
00:31:53,270 --> 00:31:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shut up!</font></font>

644
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

645
00:31:55,510 --> 00:31:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If the rabbit demon can change its form,</font></font>

646
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:58,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it could be hiding here.</font></font>

647
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That wisp of malice must be nearby.</font></font>

648
00:32:01,350 --> 00:32:02,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've already searched the village.</font></font>

649
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone here is an ordinary villager.</font></font>

650
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of them is a rabbit demon in disguise.</font></font>

651
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then again,</font></font>

652
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've lost my powers,</font></font>

653
00:32:09,310 --> 00:32:10,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I might have missed something.</font></font>

654
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If...</font></font>

655
00:32:18,030 --> 00:32:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

656
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you think I'm stupid?</font></font>

657
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I give you back your spiritual mark,</font></font>

658
00:32:21,350 --> 00:32:22,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be dead before</font></font>

659
00:32:22,510 --> 00:32:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we find the rabbit demon.</font></font>

660
00:32:23,830 --> 00:32:24,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then what do you suggest?</font></font>

661
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe we could ask around</font></font>

662
00:32:27,350 --> 00:32:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the village</font></font>

663
00:32:28,790 --> 00:32:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and find out</font></font>

664
00:32:30,160 --> 00:32:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what happened here before,</font></font>

665
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and when that rabbit demon first appeared.</font></font>

666
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And Xiangyuan's husband, Cheng Kong...</font></font>

667
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who exactly is he?</font></font>

668
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And another thing.</font></font>

669
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why does everyone</font></font>

670
00:32:40,550 --> 00:32:41,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep mistaking His Lordship</font></font>

671
00:32:41,790 --> 00:32:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for Xiangyuan's husband?</font></font>

672
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If they can mistake me for someone else,</font></font>

673
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:46,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it means these people</font></font>

674
00:32:46,750 --> 00:32:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">aren't fully conscious during the day.</font></font>

675
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once I overcome the Wanjun Lock again,</font></font>

676
00:32:52,110 --> 00:32:53,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be able to purge this place</font></font>

677
00:32:53,510 --> 00:32:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of demonic aura.</font></font>

678
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I have to, I'll raze this village.</font></font>

679
00:32:56,960 --> 00:32:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That rabbit demon won't escape me.</font></font>

680
00:32:58,750 --> 00:32:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Absurd.</font></font>

681
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ordinary people live here.</font></font>

682
00:33:02,270 --> 00:33:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't just destroy their homes.</font></font>

683
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can we stop talking</font></font>

684
00:33:06,560 --> 00:33:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about destroying the village?</font></font>

685
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're nowhere near that point yet.</font></font>

686
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I can get to the bottom of this,</font></font>

687
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why would we need your help?</font></font>

688
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just a rabbit demon.</font></font>

689
00:33:13,440 --> 00:33:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It can only prey on</font></font>

690
00:33:14,260 --> 00:33:15,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">defenseless mortals.</font></font>

691
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When night falls,</font></font>

692
00:33:17,160 --> 00:33:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll kill it myself.</font></font>

693
00:33:19,790 --> 00:33:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao.</font></font>

694
00:33:20,480 --> 00:33:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

695
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go see what we can find out.</font></font>

696
00:33:29,110 --> 00:33:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

697
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nothing.</font></font>

698
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you all</font></font>

699
00:33:38,030 --> 00:33:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">go out at night?</font></font>

700
00:33:39,070 --> 00:33:40,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We usually stay inside at night.</font></font>

701
00:33:40,740 --> 00:33:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- We stay in. - Why?</font></font>

702
00:33:43,070 --> 00:33:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's nothing to do at night.</font></font>

703
00:33:44,370 --> 00:33:45,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So we head home early.</font></font>

704
00:33:45,810 --> 00:33:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's right.</font></font>

705
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We just wash up and go to bed.</font></font>

706
00:33:49,510 --> 00:33:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

707
00:33:50,960 --> 00:33:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey.</font></font>

708
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you sitting here all alone?</font></font>

709
00:33:55,790 --> 00:33:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is something bothering you?</font></font>

710
00:33:58,590 --> 00:33:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

711
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does anything strange happen at night?</font></font>

712
00:34:03,550 --> 00:34:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your cousin and her husband</font></font>

713
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have been asking everyone about the rabbit demon today.</font></font>

714
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:07,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey, do you know</font></font>

715
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what's gotten into them?</font></font>

716
00:34:10,030 --> 00:34:10,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are they suddenly</font></font>

717
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:12,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so interested in these strange stories?</font></font>

718
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:14,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When did the rabbit demon first appear?</font></font>

719
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you asking about it too?</font></font>

720
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's been quite a few years now.</font></font>

721
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't quite remember.</font></font>

722
00:34:28,440 --> 00:34:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then when did I leave?</font></font>

723
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And why?</font></font>

724
00:34:32,110 --> 00:34:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said you had something to find.</font></font>

725
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you left,</font></font>

726
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:38,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think that's when the rabbit demon started causing trouble.</font></font>

727
00:34:39,670 --> 00:34:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So that means</font></font>

728
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've been gone for years.</font></font>

729
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:45,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What was I looking for?</font></font>

730
00:34:52,480 --> 00:34:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you asking all this?</font></font>

731
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:54,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the one who wants to know</font></font>

732
00:34:55,150 --> 00:34:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what really happened to you</font></font>

733
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when you went into the mountains this time.</font></font>

734
00:34:58,030 --> 00:34:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ever since you came back,</font></font>

735
00:34:59,070 --> 00:35:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everyone says you're a different man.</font></font>

736
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I feel the same way.</font></font>

737
00:35:02,070 --> 00:35:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you think I'm so strange,</font></font>

738
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:05,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then stop treating me like your husband.</font></font>

739
00:35:05,670 --> 00:35:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey, where are you going?</font></font>

740
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Miss?</font></font>

741
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

742
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey!</font></font>

743
00:35:16,510 --> 00:35:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened to your cousin?</font></font>

744
00:35:18,070 --> 00:35:19,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She was perfectly fine,</font></font>

745
00:35:19,400 --> 00:35:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then suddenly fainted.</font></font>

746
00:35:20,340 --> 00:35:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

747
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong.</font></font>

748
00:35:24,960 --> 00:35:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back at Mount Leiguan,</font></font>

749
00:35:26,540 --> 00:35:28,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I could tell something was wrong with Yamao.</font></font>

750
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:30,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought it was just because</font></font>

751
00:35:30,150 --> 00:35:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she was so weak.</font></font>

752
00:35:31,550 --> 00:35:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you say</font></font>

753
00:35:33,110 --> 00:35:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">her vital energy was depleted?</font></font>

754
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord,</font></font>

755
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao</font></font>

756
00:35:39,190 --> 00:35:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can no longer withstand</font></font>

757
00:35:40,060 --> 00:35:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the dark energy you use to water the mystical flower.</font></font>

758
00:35:42,110 --> 00:35:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Moonlit Revival Herb</font></font>

759
00:35:43,110 --> 00:35:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is pure by nature.</font></font>

760
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But your dark energy</font></font>

761
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is fierce and overwhelming.</font></font>

762
00:35:46,550 --> 00:35:47,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The two are completely incompatible.</font></font>

763
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must stop watering the mystical flower.</font></font>

764
00:35:49,710 --> 00:35:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Absolutely not.</font></font>

765
00:35:50,960 --> 00:35:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you keep this up,</font></font>

766
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll end up killing her.</font></font>

767
00:35:56,670 --> 00:35:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You keep saying</font></font>

768
00:35:58,150 --> 00:35:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're worried about her safety.</font></font>

769
00:36:00,550 --> 00:36:01,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But didn't you come here</font></font>

770
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for her herb core?</font></font>

771
00:36:05,070 --> 00:36:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Arguing about this now</font></font>

772
00:36:06,150 --> 00:36:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">won't help anyone.</font></font>

773
00:36:07,230 --> 00:36:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make some pills to restore her vital energy.</font></font>

774
00:36:11,360 --> 00:36:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We don't need your help.</font></font>

775
00:36:12,590 --> 00:36:13,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For all we know, what you make</font></font>

776
00:36:13,530 --> 00:36:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could be poison instead of medicine.</font></font>

777
00:36:14,590 --> 00:36:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Lordship and I will find a way</font></font>

778
00:36:15,860 --> 00:36:16,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to restore her strength.</font></font>

779
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:07,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you really</font></font>

780
00:37:07,010 --> 00:37:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my husband's cousin?</font></font>

781
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why have I never heard him</font></font>

782
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">mention you before?</font></font>

783
00:37:11,840 --> 00:37:13,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And why has he been</font></font>

784
00:37:15,030 --> 00:37:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a different man ever since you showed up?</font></font>

785
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Drink this.</font></font>

786
00:37:33,150 --> 00:37:33,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once you finish it,</font></font>

787
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everything will be fine.</font></font>

788
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you trying to do?</font></font>

789
00:37:53,590 --> 00:37:54,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong.</font></font>

790
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:56,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you think I'm trying to do?</font></font>

791
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Poison her?</font></font>

792
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What I just gave her</font></font>

793
00:38:10,070 --> 00:38:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was the well water you've been</font></font>

794
00:38:11,810 --> 00:38:12,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so desperate to find.</font></font>

795
00:38:13,070 --> 00:38:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said yourself it worked wonders.</font></font>

796
00:38:16,550 --> 00:38:17,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan...</font></font>

797
00:38:17,110 --> 00:38:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't call me!</font></font>

798
00:38:19,590 --> 00:38:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was kind enough to help you save her,</font></font>

799
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you keep pushing me aside</font></font>

800
00:38:21,810 --> 00:38:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for her sake!</font></font>

801
00:38:23,840 --> 00:38:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to see either of you.</font></font>

802
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're awake.</font></font>

803
00:38:39,030 --> 00:38:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What just happened?</font></font>

804
00:38:40,190 --> 00:38:41,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We figured out why you fainted.</font></font>

805
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your body can no longer handle</font></font>

806
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the dark energy used to water the mystical flower.</font></font>

807
00:38:44,550 --> 00:38:45,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If this keeps up,</font></font>

808
00:38:46,190 --> 00:38:46,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it won't end well.</font></font>

809
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The water Xiangyuan just gave me</font></font>

810
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">really did help with my weakness.</font></font>

811
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could that water</font></font>

812
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">neutralize the dark energy?</font></font>

813
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:58,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This water</font></font>

814
00:38:59,230 --> 00:39:00,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">comes from the same source as the lake</font></font>

815
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on Mount Qihuang.</font></font>

816
00:39:02,320 --> 00:39:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But those places are so far apart.</font></font>

817
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something's definitely strange about this place.</font></font>

818
00:39:06,030 --> 00:39:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As for what we found out today,</font></font>

819
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the day Cheng Kong disappeared</font></font>

820
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was the same day the rabbit demon</font></font>

821
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">started causing trouble.</font></font>

822
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Every clue points to Cheng Kong.</font></font>

823
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only by restoring Xiangyuan's memory</font></font>

824
00:39:15,960 --> 00:39:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can we find out</font></font>

825
00:39:16,550 --> 00:39:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what really happened.</font></font>

826
00:39:17,670 --> 00:39:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Easy for you to say!</font></font>

827
00:39:19,190 --> 00:39:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How are we supposed to restore her memory?</font></font>

828
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:21,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides,</font></font>

829
00:39:22,070 --> 00:39:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Lordship just had</font></font>

830
00:39:23,510 --> 00:39:24,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a huge fight with Xiangyuan.</font></font>

831
00:39:24,590 --> 00:39:26,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She doesn't want to see you right now.</font></font>

832
00:39:49,590 --> 00:39:50,860
